{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4gqbRvgrESdb6NbRHg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-banded, weathered by centuries of hands pressing against its grain.*\n\n*You hold up a key.*\n\n*A keyhole materializes in the wood, dark and deep, ringed with tarnished brass. The door waits.*\n\n*You insert the key. It fits. You turn it.*\n\n**CLUNK.**\n\n*The mechanism groans — tumblers falling like old bones settling into place. The iron bands shudder. A thin line of light splits the door vertically, then horizontally, then in fractures that spread like veins through the wood.*\n\n*The door swings inward.*\n\n*Beyond: a corridor of warm amber light stretching further than it should, the smell of rain on stone, and the faintest sound — someone, somewhere, breathing in relief, as though they had been waiting a very long time for you to arrive.*\n\n*The door is open.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":208,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}